    <div class="prose-doc mt-8">
      <p>The DistLLM software is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. This website is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind.</p>
      <p>Benchmark numbers published on this site reflect specific hardware and workload configurations; your results will vary. We encourage you to run the built-in benchmark suite on your own cluster.</p>
      <p>You are responsible for complying with all applicable laws when deploying models and processing data with DistLLM, including data-protection regulations applicable to your jurisdiction.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
